            "review_title": "Review at Okonomiyaki Miyakoya",
            "review_text": "finkamanda\nHo Chi Minh City, Vietnam3 contributions\n0\nYummy Okonomiyaki\nJan 2018 • Couples\nWe found this place after a recent trip to Japan and fell in love with okonomiyaki. We've been here 3 times in the past month! The staff are very friendly and accommodating. I wrote \"khong tit\" on a sheet of paper to let them know I am a vegetarian. I got the cheese okonomiyaki and the mushroom and chicken soba noodles w/o the chicken. It's great value for what you get! We always get sake too!\nRead more\nValue\nService\nFood\nReview collected in partnership with this restaurant \nWritten January 5, 2018",
