            "review_text": "David D\nAdelaide, Australia889 contributions\n0\nGreat Cuisine even if I wasn't sure about what I was eating\nSep 2015 • Business\nBusiness colleagues took to this great little restaurant in the Aeon Shopping mall. The staff were fantastic and cooked the dishes to perfection. The \"omelette\" was amazing, almost a work of art. We also shared a \"hot pot\" comprising pork, fish balls and prawns. a great experience and fantastic value.\nValue\nService\nFood\nWritten September 25, 2015",
